{"version":1,"content":"<p>【19：49更新】今日（29日）下午2時許，警方接報指黃大仙道及馬仔坑道交界爆水管。</p><p>黃大仙上邨緊急暫停食水供應，水務署派水車到場為居民提供食水，預計明日（30日）凌晨3時恢復供水。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T12:18:16.849653+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":91,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T09:25:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T02:38:08.169497+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T12:18:16.849653+00:00","content_hash":"a6d46c95a5ee7074888f7ce36a5071c9e4a6e40c805613bcd77b1897f74314b9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}